# Repo-local service defaults live here.
#
# Common options:
# - Set LLAMA_PROFILE_FILE to one of the checked-in profile env files.
# - Set individual LLAMA_* variables here when you need a custom combination.
# - Put machine-specific overrides in /etc/default/llama-server so they win over this file.
#
# Example overrides:
# LLAMA_PROFILE_FILE=/home/jac/gitrepos/pi-dev-agent/scripts/llama-server.profile.q8-coding.env
# LLAMA_MODEL_PATH=/home/jac/models/your-model.gguf
# LLAMA_PORT=1234
LLAMA_PROFILE_FILE=/home/jac/scripts/llama-server.profile.large-context.env